      "text": "In a press conference, President Prabowo agrees to revoke the allowance for parliament members and put moratoriums to their foreign trips. ((CNA))"
    },
    {
      "category": "Law and crime",
      "text": "A university student dies one day after participating in a protest in Yogyakarta one day prior, after he was allegedly separated from other protestors and assaulted by police. ((Kompas))"
    },
    {
      "category": "Disasters and accidents",
      "text": "Two people are killed and eight Kenyan police officers are injured in an accident involving two armored vehicles in the Port-au-Prince Arrondissement, Haiti. ((AP))"
